u sincerely for your time and consideration.\\n\\nWarm regards,\\nJohn Utah\",\"reasoning\":\"John Utah is a strong match for this Senior Software Engineer role at Stripe because his 5 years of full-stack experience directly aligns with the required qualifications, and his core technical stack of React, TypeScript, and Node.js mirrors exactly what Stripe is looking for. His background shipping features to hundreds of thousands of users demonstrates he can operate at the scale and reliability standards that payment infrastructure demands. Additionally, his experience with PostgreSQL, REST APIs, and AWS, combined with a track record of working in collaborative Agile environments, reflects the engineering culture Stripe is known for.\"}"}
